    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2NkrtdVQB7ta1ft5gbxAUVr)_\n\nBefore: 28 changelog entries were 300 to 1500 characters long, with the whole explanation in the entry.\n\nAfter:\n- Each long entry is one sentence ending in `Details: [[file:docs/tangles/...]]`, with the PR link first as before.\n- The original text of each moved to a new `* Changes by pull request` section at the bottom of that module's doc in `docs/tangles/` (18 docs), one bullet per PR, linked back to the changelog. The section has no code blocks, so tangling is unchanged.\n- Every entry and every bullet has an emoji for its category: ✨ Added, 🔧 Changed, 🐛 Fixed, 🔥 Removed, 💡 Proposed. The intro line is the legend.\n- #109 has no doc to move to (the ADR holds its detail), so it is only shortened.\n\nNot done: the older entries under 300 characters are unchanged apart from the emoji. Not opened in Emacs or tangled.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01XHLFVQytr7NYz1hjyos2a1)_",
